     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">My basic problem is that after rendering a dygraph with error bars I cannot get multiple independent series to render.  In the code below the selection defaults to &quot;a&quot; and after viewing &quot;a&quot; or &quot;b&quot; then &quot;c&quot; will not show.  The opposite is not true however, if the default is set to &quot;c&quot; then &quot;a&quot; and &quot;b&quot; appear normally after viewing the default &quot;c&quot;, but &quot;c&quot; will not be available if you return to it later.  An example is below...<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dygraphs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Copy the line below to make a select box </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;foo&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> h3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Select box&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;a&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;b&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;c&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>              selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>           dygraphOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plotdat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>           dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;tab&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#